# Public key that signs the OWPanel release archives (E-167), in the
# allowed_signers format of ssh-keygen. get-owpanel contains the same key
# lines (tests/release.bats compares them), and the installer copies this
# file to /etc/owpanel/release-signers for later updates of the server
# scripts. To check a downloaded archive by hand:
#
#   ssh-keygen -Y verify -f release-signers -I owpanel-release -n owpanel-release \
#     -s owpanel-<version>.tar.gz.sig < owpanel-<version>.tar.gz
#
# A key line looks like this (one line per key, for a change of keys):
#
#   owpanel-release namespaces="owpanel-release" ssh-ed25519 AAAA...
owpanel-release namespaces="owpanel-release" ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAID668zKpcURWItatv7D0P9JS7ClQwzpw8ri5C9NYaYB/
